y for waking her!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_21","text":"Sure thing!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_22","text":"What in the world is going on?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_23","text":"Sorry about that!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_24","text":"I heard there's a new speech recognition feature!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_25","text":"So I'm testing it!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_26","text":"But!! It seems it can recognize!! Alice's and Tove's voices, too!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_27","text":"So, could the whole issue with your hands potentially be resolved now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_28","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_28","text":"For a while, there is no reply.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ludmilla_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_29","text":"Rabbity!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_30","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ludmilla_winterowner_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":